  - ComponentName: musl
    LicenseText: "musl as a whole is licensed under the following standard MIT license:\n\nCopyright
      \xA9 2005-2019 Rich Felker, et al.\n\nPermission is hereby granted, free of
      charge, to any person obtaining a copy of this software and associated documentation
