  - ComponentName: '"Faster Unsigned Division by Constants"'
    LicenseText: 'Reference implementations of computing and using the "magic number"
      approach to dividing

      by constants, including codegen instructions.
      The unsigned division incorporates the

      "round down" optimization per
      ridiculous_fish.

      

